{"path":"index.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Aromatic membership for steady days</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Membership-based aromatherapy services that may support calmer routines. Safety-forward, personalized blends, and short practices you can fold into the day.">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/styles.css">
  <script defer src="assets/js/main.js"></script>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="brand">
        <strong class="name">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong>
        <small class="tag">{{TAGLINE}}</small>
      </div>
      <nav class="main-nav" aria-label="Primary">
        <a href="/services.html">Offerings</a>
        <a href="/blends.html">Custom Blends</a>
        <a href="/shop.html">Apothecary</a>
        <a href="/pricing.html">Plans</a>
        <a href="/about.html">About</a>
        <a href="/book.html">Schedule</a>
        <a href="/contact.html">Connect</a>
      </nav>
      <a class="cta" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero" style="background-image:url('assets/img/pattern.svg')">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h1>Membership for steady scent support</h1>
        <p class="lead">Gentle, evidence-aware aromatherapy sessions and blends that may support ease across your day-to-day. Membership includes guided sessions, seasonal blends, and a private planner tool.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="btn primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          <a class="btn ghost" href="/pricing.html">View plans</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="social-proof" data-reveal>
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Trusted by members across the region</h2>
        <div class="cards">
          <blockquote class="card">"I look forward to monthly sessions that help me reset—simple steps I can use between visits." <cite>— P. in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</cite></blockquote>
          <blockquote class="card">"The blends are practical and subtle; I keep one in my desk drawer." <cite>— L.</cite></blockquote>
          <blockquote class="card">"Clear guidance on safety and dilution made me confident to try this practice." <cite>— M.</cite></blockquote>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="benefits highlight" data-reveal>
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>What members receive</h2>
        <ul class="benefit-list">
          <li><strong>Monthly guided session:</strong> 40–50 minute online gathering; scent techniques and take-home blends that may support daily steadiness.</li>
          <li><strong>Seasonal blend delivery:</strong> Small-batch formulas with clear dilution instructions and patch-test guidance.</li>
          <li><strong>Member library:</strong> Short practices, safety notes, and printable reminders for home use.</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="planner-block">
          <h3>Session Planner</h3>
          <p class="muted">Build a simple plan for a personalized aromatherapy session. This generates a plain-text summary you can copy or save.</p>

          <div class="session-planner" data-instance="1">
            <label>Focus for this session</label>
            <select class="sp-goal">
              <option value="calm">Calm</option>
              <option value="focus">Focus</option>
              <option value="reset">Reset</option>
              <option value="sleep">Sleep support</option>
            </select>

            <label>Session length</label>
            <select class="sp-length">
              <option value="10">10 minutes</option>
              <option value="20">20 minutes</option>
              <option value="40">40 minutes</option>
            </select>

            <label>Sensitivity notes</label>
            <input class="sp-sens" placeholder="e.g., pregnant, pets at home, citrus sensitivity">

            <label>Preferred notes (pick up to 3)</label>
            <div class="notes-checks">
              <label><input type="checkbox" value="lavender"> Lavender</label>
              <label><input type="checkbox" value="bergamot"> Bergamot</label>
              <label><input type="checkbox" value="frankincense"> Frankincense</label>
              <label><input type="checkbox" value="peppermint"> Peppermint</label>
              <label><input type="checkbox" value="vetiver"> Vetiver</label>
            </div>

            <div class="planner-actions">
              <button class="btn" data-action="build">Build plan</button>
              <button class="btn ghost" data-action="clear">Clear</button>
            </div>

            <label>Plan summary</label>
            <textarea class="sp-output" readonly rows="6" aria-label="Session plan summary"></textarea>
            <div class="planner-actions">
              <button class="btn" data-action="copy">Copy summary</button>
              <a class="btn" href="/book.html">Schedule a session</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="process" data-reveal>
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>How membership flows</h2>
        <ol class="steps">
          <li><strong>Onboard:</strong> Short intake and safety review (allergies, pregnancy, pets, medications) to tailor suggestions.</li>
          <li><strong>Meet:</strong> Monthly group or private session with guided practice and Q&amp;A.</li>
          <li><strong>Use:</strong> Seasonal blends with dilution guidance and patch-test notes for home use.</li>
        </ol>

        <div class="planner-block small">
          <h3>Session Planner (quick repeat)</h3>
          <p class="muted">Craft another short plan without leaving the page.</p>

          <div class="session-planner" data-instance="2">
            <label>Focus for this session</label>
            <select class="sp-goal">
              <option value="calm">Calm</option>
              <option value="focus">Focus</option>
              <option value="reset">Reset</option>
              <option value="sleep">Sleep support</option>
            </select>

            <label>Session length</label>
            <select class="sp-length">
              <option value="10">10 minutes</option>
              <option value="20">20 minutes</option>
              <option value="40">40 minutes</option>
            </select>

            <label>Sensitivity notes</label>
            <input class="sp-sens" placeholder="e.g., pregnant, pets at home, citrus sensitivity">

            <label>Preferred notes (pick up to 3)</label>
            <div class="notes-checks">
              <label><input type="checkbox" value="lavender"> Lavender</label>
              <label><input type="checkbox" value="bergamot"> Bergamot</label>
              <label><input type="checkbox" value="frankincense"> Frankincense</label>
              <label><input type="checkbox" value="peppermint"> Peppermint</label>
              <label><input type="checkbox" value="vetiver"> Vetiver</label>
            </div>

            <div class="planner-actions">
              <button class="btn" data-action="build">Build plan</button>
              <button class="btn ghost" data-action="clear">Clear</button>
            </div>

            <label>Plan summary</label>
            <textarea class="sp-output" readonly rows="6" aria-label="Session plan summary"></textarea>
            <div class="planner-actions">
              <button class="btn" data-action="copy">Copy summary</button>
              <a class="btn" href="/pricing.html">Choose a plan</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="faq" data-reveal>
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Frequently asked safety questions</h2>
        <div class="qa">
          <h3>How should I dilute essential oils?</h3>
          <p>We recommend starting at conservative dilutions: 0.5–2% for topical blends depending on area and sensitivity. For household diffusing, follow short session durations and ventilate the room.</p>

          <h3>What is a patch test?</h3>
          <p>A patch test means applying one diluted drop to a small area of skin and observing 24 hours for irritation. If you notice redness or discomfort, discontinue use.</p>

          <h3>Are essential oils safe around pets?</h3>
          <p>Some oils may affect pets. Keep blends and diffusing periods limited, avoid direct contact with animals, and share pet details during intake so we can adapt recommendations.</p>

          <h3>What about pregnancy or nursing?</h3>
          <p>Pregnancy and breastfeeding involve unique considerations. Always disclose pregnancy/nursing during intake so suggestions emphasize safety and avoid certain botanicals.</p>

          <h3>Do these practices treat medical conditions?</h3>
          <p>No. These are supportive scent practices that may support well-being. They are not a substitute for medical care. Always consult your healthcare provider for medical concerns.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="callout cta" data-reveal>
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Ready to begin a steady scent practice?</h2>
        <p class="muted">Membership welcomes newcomers and experienced users. We emphasize safety, clear dilution, and practical blends you can actually use.</p>
        <div class="cta-actions">
          <a class="btn large" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          <a class="btn ghost" href="/contact.html">Ask a question</a>
        </div>
        <p class="contact">Or call <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> • <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p>&copy; <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Based in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. All safety guidance is educational in nature.</p>
    </div>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>"} 
